Package: tarr.pop
Type: Package
Title: Population figures for Tarrant and other selected areas like Texas and comparable counties
Version: 0.0.0.9223
Description: Population figures and functions to retrieve subsets of the data.
    Data is stored on disk in multidimensional arrays or cubes. Operations
    use delayed evaluation, and selected results can be retrieved into memory.
    Contains population figures for Texas, Tarrant County, comparable large
    counties, and counties in the metroplex. Data sources include the U.S.
    Census Bureau decennial census and population estimates, ACS population
    estimates by ZIP Code Tabulation Area, Texas Demographic Center estimates
    and projections, and National Cancer Institute SEER population estimates
    and standard populations used for adjustments.
